
"smart_sources:2026-03-31 - Little signs Idaho bill criminalizing use of bathrooms that don’t match birth sex (Conflicted copy Laptop (IdahoPTV) 202607081724).md": {"path":"2026-03-31 - Little signs Idaho bill criminalizing use of bathrooms that don’t match birth sex (Conflicted copy Laptop (IdahoPTV) 202607081724).md","last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"last_read":{"hash":"5kk3fr","at":1785795031879},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1783553054785,"size":4338,"at":1785795031994,"hash":"5kk3fr"},"blocks":{"#---frontmatter---":[1,9],"#":[10,44]},"outlinks":[{"title":"Becca Savransky","target":"Becca Savransky","line":5},{"title":"Idaho Gov. Brad Little signed House Bill 752, which criminalizes the use of bathrooms or changing rooms that don’t correspond to a person’s sex at birth.","target":"https://www.idahostatesman.com/public/latest-news/rdv27s/picture315198677/alternates/LANDSCAPE_1200/339A9939_Little.jpg","line":10,"embedded":true}],"metadata":{"title":"Little signs Idaho bill criminalizing use of bathrooms that don’t match birth sex","source":"https://www.idahostatesman.com/news/politics-government/state-politics/article315257130.html#campaignName=boise_politics_newsletter","author":["[[Becca Savransky]]"],"published":"2026-03-31","created":"2026-07-07","description":"The crime is a misdemeanor on first offense, and the state now has “the most extreme anti-transgender bathroom ban in the nation.”"},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},